<programme start="20261025220000 +0000" stop="20261026010000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Pittsburgh at Miami</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Panthers (5-2) visit the No. 1 Hurricanes (6-0) in an ACC matchup. The Hurricanes beat the Seminoles 43-35 in overtime behind three TDs from Darian Mensah. The Panthers fell to the Eagles 27-21 and rely on QB Mason Heintschel who has 14 TDs.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261026010000 +0000" stop="20261026040000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Syracuse at North Carolina</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Orange (2-4) play the Tar Heels (4-2) for an ACC match at Kenan Stadium. North Carolina looks for a third straight win and beat Duke 24-20. Syracuse fell to Louisville 34-26 and rely on QB Steve Angeli who has four TDs and five INTs this season.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261026040000 +0000" stop="20261026070000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Boston College at Georgia Tech</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Eagles and the Yellow Jackets clash in an ACC game at Bobby Dodd Stadium. Boston College defeated Pittsburgh, 27-21, where Mason McKenzie threw for two touchdowns. Georgia Tech looks to bounce back from a 34-24 loss against Virginia Tech.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261026070000 +0000" stop="20261026100000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Duke at Virginia</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Virginia Cavaliers clash with the Duke Blue Devils in ACC conference play. Virginia relies on quarterback Beau Pribula after his rushing touchdown against SMU, while Duke counts on Nate Sheppard following his 98 receiving yards on October 17.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
