<programme start="20261024122300 +0000" stop="20261024130700 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Terror</title><sub-title lang="en">Infamy: Shatter Like a Pearl</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Japanese Americans are forced to undertake a humiliating exercise that divides the community; Chester comes face to face with a man who forces him to question his very nature; Luz, stricken by grief, is forced to make an important choice.</desc><credits><actor>Derek Mio</actor><actor>Shingo Usami</actor><actor>Naoko Mori</actor></credits><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15107294_b_v12_ad.jpg"/></programme>
