<programme start="20261024190800 +0000" stop="20261024195100 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Terror</title><sub-title lang="en">Infamy: The Weak Are Meat</sub-title><desc lang="en">Chester, in search of a better life, is treated with hostility by his fellow Americans; Luz hopes to be accepted by Henry and Asako in their new home as the Japanese American community celebrates Obon, a festival to commemorate the dead.</desc><credits><actor>Derek Mio</actor><actor>Shingo Usami</actor><actor>Naoko Mori</actor></credits><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15107294_b_v12_ad.jpg"/></programme>
