<programme start="20261026010000 +0000" stop="20261026020000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</title><sub-title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</sub-title><desc lang="es">Hay una nueva audiencia entre Clara y Gael. Clara lidera la inspección en la mina y detienen a Sofía. Livia visita a Renato para pedirle que vuelvan.</desc><credits><director>André Binder</director><actor>Bianca Bin</actor><actor>Sergio Guizé</actor><actor>Grazi Massafera</actor><actor>Rafael Cardoso</actor><actor>Marieta Severo</actor><actor>Eriberto Leão</actor><actor>Fernanda Montenegro</actor><actor>Flávio Tolezani</actor><actor>Gloria Pires</actor><actor>Nathalia Timberg</actor><actor>Juliano Cazarré</actor><actor>Lima Duarte</actor><actor>Emílio Mello</actor><actor>Emílio de Mello</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Thiago Fragoso</actor><actor>Bárbara Paz</actor><actor>Érika Januza</actor><actor>Alejandro Claveaux</actor><actor>Caio Paduan</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Arthur Aguiar</actor><actor>Mayana Neiva</actor><actor>Laura Cardoso</actor></credits><date>20191218</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.41.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E42</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-G</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/2c1838007124da8533ada11fb572682e.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261026020000 +0000" stop="20261026030000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El clon</title><sub-title lang="es">Reconciliación</sub-title><desc lang="es">Tavinho llega al Sambódromo con Nazira. Anita y Edna tienen una cita con el detective. Said amenaza a Ranya con devolverla si ayuda a Jade. Lucas le pide a Maysa que deje de perjudicar a Xande. Mohamed y Latiffa se reconcilian.</desc><credits><director>Jayme Monjardim</director><actor>Murilo Benício</actor><actor>Giovanna Antonelli</actor><actor>Letícia Sabatella</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Adriana Lessa</actor><actor>Vera Fischer</actor><actor>Reginaldo Faria</actor><actor>Dalton Vigh</actor><actor>Daniela Escobar</actor><actor>Débora Falabella</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Antonio Calloni</actor><actor>Stênio Garcia</actor><actor>Jandira Martini</actor><actor>Neuza Borges</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Nívea Maria</actor><actor>Solange Couto</actor><actor>Osmar Prado</actor><actor>Cissa Guimarães</actor><actor>Marcos Frota</actor><actor>Sthefany Brito</actor></credits><date>20261019</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.129.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E130</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/055e21a87f08305eee3cdcba080e2379.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261026030000 +0000" stop="20261026040000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El clon</title><sub-title lang="es">Nuevo departamento</sub-title><desc lang="es">Said no permite que Jade se despida de su hija. Edna invita a Deusa y Léo a cenar en casa. Escobar planea comprar un departamento y ponerlo a nombre de Alicinha. Maysa le pide ayuda a Said para que Xande sea despedido y Mel regrese a casa.</desc><credits><director>Jayme Monjardim</director><actor>Murilo Benício</actor><actor>Giovanna Antonelli</actor><actor>Letícia Sabatella</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Adriana Lessa</actor><actor>Vera Fischer</actor><actor>Reginaldo Faria</actor><actor>Dalton Vigh</actor><actor>Daniela Escobar</actor><actor>Débora Falabella</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Antonio Calloni</actor><actor>Stênio Garcia</actor><actor>Jandira Martini</actor><actor>Neuza Borges</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Nívea Maria</actor><actor>Solange Couto</actor><actor>Osmar Prado</actor><actor>Cissa Guimarães</actor><actor>Marcos Frota</actor><actor>Sthefany Brito</actor></credits><date>20261020</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.130.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E131</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/6be018843df8b712f1b2f0b519c62469.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261026040000 +0000" stop="20261026050000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El clon</title><sub-title lang="es">Adicciones</sub-title><desc lang="es">Said ayuda a Maysa para que esté más tranquila. Carol promete apoyar a Lobato con su alcoholismo. Nando y Ceceu fuman marihuana en casa de Lidiane. Albieri, al sentirse presionado, piensa en llevarse lejos a Léo.</desc><credits><director>Jayme Monjardim</director><actor>Murilo Benício</actor><actor>Giovanna Antonelli</actor><actor>Letícia Sabatella</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Adriana Lessa</actor><actor>Vera Fischer</actor><actor>Reginaldo Faria</actor><actor>Dalton Vigh</actor><actor>Daniela Escobar</actor><actor>Débora Falabella</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Antonio Calloni</actor><actor>Stênio Garcia</actor><actor>Jandira Martini</actor><actor>Neuza Borges</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Nívea Maria</actor><actor>Solange Couto</actor><actor>Osmar Prado</actor><actor>Cissa Guimarães</actor><actor>Marcos Frota</actor><actor>Sthefany Brito</actor></credits><date>20261021</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.131.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E132</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1280x720/4161e7e51f30e947e24e25cc56ad0224.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261026050000 +0000" stop="20261026060000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El clon</title><sub-title lang="es">Despedido</sub-title><desc lang="es">Zoraide le avisa a Jade que Lucas no intentará robar a Khadijja. Escobar llama a su hijo y lo pone al tanto del novio de su madre. Xande es despedido. Maysa acusa a Lucas de no mostrar interés en traer a su hija de vuelta a casa.</desc><credits><director>Jayme Monjardim</director><actor>Murilo Benício</actor><actor>Giovanna Antonelli</actor><actor>Letícia Sabatella</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Adriana Lessa</actor><actor>Vera Fischer</actor><actor>Reginaldo Faria</actor><actor>Dalton Vigh</actor><actor>Daniela Escobar</actor><actor>Débora Falabella</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Antonio Calloni</actor><actor>Stênio Garcia</actor><actor>Jandira Martini</actor><actor>Neuza Borges</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Nívea Maria</actor><actor>Solange Couto</actor><actor>Osmar Prado</actor><actor>Cissa Guimarães</actor><actor>Marcos Frota</actor><actor>Sthefany Brito</actor></credits><date>20261022</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.132.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E133</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/b187c445605de89773605da881bab112.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261026060000 +0000" stop="20261026070000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El clon</title><sub-title lang="es">Clonación</sub-title><desc lang="es">Alicinha y Escobar festejan la compra del departamento. Edvaldo le sugiere a Deusa llevar a Léo con Edna. Albieri le propone a Edna hacer un clon de Lucas. Lobato, al estar borracho, piensa que Léo es el espíritu de Diogo.</desc><credits><director>Jayme Monjardim</director><actor>Murilo Benício</actor><actor>Giovanna Antonelli</actor><actor>Letícia Sabatella</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Adriana Lessa</actor><actor>Vera Fischer</actor><actor>Reginaldo Faria</actor><actor>Dalton Vigh</actor><actor>Daniela Escobar</actor><actor>Débora Falabella</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Antonio Calloni</actor><actor>Stênio Garcia</actor><actor>Jandira Martini</actor><actor>Neuza Borges</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Nívea Maria</actor><actor>Solange Couto</actor><actor>Osmar Prado</actor><actor>Cissa Guimarães</actor><actor>Marcos Frota</actor><actor>Sthefany Brito</actor></credits><date>20261023</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.133.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E134</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/8eb7587c91b3193a845f9a97a8556824.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261026070000 +0000" stop="20261026080000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">La tierra prometida</title><sub-title lang="es">Traidores</sub-title><desc lang="es">Josué celebra con sus guerreros la victoria de haber conquistado Jericó. El rey Durgal enfurece al ver que Yusuf ha perdido la guerra contra Josué.</desc><credits><director>Alexandre Avancini</director><actor>Sidney Sampaio</actor><actor>Thaís Melchior</actor><actor>Paloma Bernardi</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Kadu Moliterno</actor><actor>Leonardo Miggiorin</actor><actor>Nívea Stelmann</actor><actor>Marcos Winter</actor><actor>Juliana Silveira</actor><actor>Beth Goulart</actor><actor>Luciana Braga</actor><actor>Raymundo Souza</actor><actor>Ricky Tavares</actor><actor>Ana Barroso</actor></credits><date>20261024</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.70.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E71</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/452eed8fd188f8b28af2965bd1c5116e.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261026080000 +0000" stop="20261026090000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">La tierra prometida</title><sub-title lang="es">Celos incontrolables</sub-title><desc lang="es">Kamir le promete a Yusuf la mano de Melina. Samara entristece al ver el rostro de Tobías lastimado. Jessica no puede controlar sus celos al ver a Rahab cerca de Salmón.</desc><credits><director>Alexandre Avancini</director><actor>Sidney Sampaio</actor><actor>Thaís Melchior</actor><actor>Paloma Bernardi</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Kadu Moliterno</actor><actor>Leonardo Miggiorin</actor><actor>Nívea Stelmann</actor><actor>Marcos Winter</actor><actor>Juliana Silveira</actor><actor>Beth Goulart</actor><actor>Luciana Braga</actor><actor>Raymundo Souza</actor><actor>Ricky Tavares</actor><actor>Ana Barroso</actor></credits><date>20261024</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.71.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E72</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/451475a2937a752afe1d352fea58d478.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261026090000 +0000" stop="20261026100000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">La tierra prometida</title><sub-title lang="es">Malos consejos</sub-title><desc lang="es">Kamir consulta a una sacerdotisa para saber cuál es el futuro de su pueblo. Samara busca la manera de que Aruna no conquiste el corazón de Josué.</desc><credits><director>Alexandre Avancini</director><actor>Sidney Sampaio</actor><actor>Thaís Melchior</actor><actor>Paloma Bernardi</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Kadu Moliterno</actor><actor>Leonardo Miggiorin</actor><actor>Nívea Stelmann</actor><actor>Marcos Winter</actor><actor>Juliana Silveira</actor><actor>Beth Goulart</actor><actor>Luciana Braga</actor><actor>Raymundo Souza</actor><actor>Ricky Tavares</actor><actor>Ana Barroso</actor></credits><date>20261024</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.72.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E73</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/ab6c6f2924819376bf5c11a6b6524676.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261026100000 +0000" stop="20261026110000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El gran seductor</title><sub-title lang="es">Un corazón roto</sub-title><desc lang="es">Kwon Shi-Hyun, Choi Soo-Ji y Lee Se-Joo son tres amigos inseparables que acaban de graduarse. Cuando el exnovio de Soo-Ji la humilla frente a sus amigos y termina su relación con ella, Soo-Ji decide cobrar venganza.</desc><credits><actor>Woo Do-hwan</actor><actor>Park Soo-young</actor><actor>Kim Min-jae</actor><actor>Moon Ga-young</actor></credits><date>20250529</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.0.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E01</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/47c74fdcfd67fb5b489920af2adbb86c.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261026110000 +0000" stop="20261026120000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">Moisés y los diez mandamientos</title><sub-title lang="es">Moisés y los diez mandamientos</sub-title><desc lang="es">La historia de Moisés desde su nacimiento y llegada a manos de la princesa Henutmire hasta llevar a su pueblo a la Tierra Prometida. Su crianza como un verdadero príncipe egipcio junto a su tío Ramsés.</desc><credits><director>Alexandre Avancini</director><actor>Guilherme Winter</actor><actor>Sérgio Marone</actor><actor>Camila Rodrigues</actor><actor>Giselle Itié</actor><actor>Petrônio Gontijo</actor><actor>Gabriela Durlo</actor><actor>Giuseppe Oristânio</actor><actor>Luciano Szafir</actor><actor>Juliana Didone</actor><actor>Eduardo Lago</actor><actor>Thierry Figueira</actor></credits><date>20240125</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.48.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E49</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/479cb1036e968fc3b47df6c5f9bfc04b.jpeg"/></programme>
